OL,3,AKenyan family protest extradition
OL,4,Ahearing delay of ex-British soldier
OL,5,Aaccused of murdering kin
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hearing for Robert James Purkiss, a
OL,8,Fformer British soldier accused of
OL,9,Fkilling the 21-year-old mother, had
OL,10,Fbeen due next month. The family said it
OL,11,Fhad now been postponed until May 2027.
OL,12,FPurkiss was arrested in the UK last
OL,13,FNovember and is fighting extradition to
OL,14,FKenya to face trial for murder. He
OL,15,Fdenies the allegation.
OL,17,FWanjiru's niece, Esther Njoki, told the
OL,18,FBBC that the family learnt of the
OL,19,Fpostponement through the UK embassy and
OL,20,Fhad received no official explanation.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
